OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to stop housing asylum      
OL,4,Aseekers                                
OL,6,FA hotel in Coventry will no longer be  
OL,7,Fused as accommodation for asylum       
OL,8,Fseekers, the government has announced. 
OL,10,FThe Days Hotel, on Holyhead Road has   
OL,11,Fbeen used by the Home Office to house  
OL,12,Fasylum seekers since January 2023.     
OL,14,FThe government said the closure was due
OL,15,Fto a fall in small boat arrivals and   
OL,16,Fasylum claims, faster processing of    
OL,17,Fapplications and an increase in returns
OL,18,Fand deportations from the UK.          
OL,20,FIt was announced earlier this week that
OL,21,FWarwick's Delta Hotel would also close 
OL,22,Ffrom early next year.                  
